  "worked_solution": "The figure consists of two layers:\n\n- The bottom layer consists of $5$ cubes.\n\n- The top layer consists of $3$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/e48dc7a3aedee4e13cd18a68abfc65ac3fc241b426ff846f9dab21368b813c86.png)\n\nTherefore, the volume is $5+3=8$ cubic feet.",
